","old_project_id":0,"project_id":0,"old_milestone":null,"milestone":null,"tracked_time":null,"old_title":"","new_title":"","old_ref":"","new_ref":"","ref_issue":{"id":612678,"url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/discussions/issues/79","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/discussions/issues/79","number":79,"user":{"id":73579,"login":"earl-warren","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"Earl Warren","email":"earl-warren@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/baa02ddebf727ef06a0ded0aee5a25cc","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/earl-warren","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2022-11-26T18:56:24+01:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","pronouns":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":50,"following_count":2,"starred_repos_count":28,"username":"earl-warren"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"title":"Forgejo specific commits","body":"A list of pull requests merged in Forgejo and proposed to Gitea but delcined or blocked for some reason. They are likely to stay in Forgejo durably.\n\nAll pull requests that contain a copyrighted work are de facto excluded because [Gitea requires copyright assignment](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/discussions/issues/67) in addition to MIT license and they cannot be contributed. See [\"notifies admins on new user registration\"](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/27128) or [\"rework long-term authentication\"](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/27455) which were proposed and blocked, before the policy was made explicit.\n\nThe **copyright** mentioned next to a PR means that it contains copyrighted material that would require a copyright assignment to Gitea and cannot be contributed because of that.\n\n* [forgejo-dependency](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/commits/branch/forgejo-dependency)\n  * [silently ignore obsolete sudo scope](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/822) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/25156)\n  * [Add password length check on install page](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/927) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/25491)\n  * [Allow release creation on commit](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/1200) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/25491)\n  * [Improve HTML title on repositories](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/1283) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/27020)\n  * [Tidy up archive modal](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/1432) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/27131)\n  * [Drop sha256-simd in favor of stdlib](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/1528) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/27895)\n  * [New doctor check: fix-push-mirrors-without-git-remote](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/1853) - copyright\n* [forgejo-development](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/commits/branch/forgejo-development)\n  * [Use OpenStreetMap in USER_LOCATION_MAP_URL by default](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/1189) - [Gitea PR](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/26214)\n","ref":"","assets":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":null,"state":"closed","is_locked":false,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-11-03T23:25:44+01:00","updated_at":"2024-02-18T16:30:42+01:00","closed_at":"2024-02-18T16:30:42+01:00","due_date":null,"pull_request":null,"repository":{"id":96959,"name":"discussions","owner":"forgejo","full_name":"forgejo/discussions"},"pin_order":0},"ref_comment":null,"ref_action":"none","ref_commit_sha":"","review_id":0,"label":null,"assignee":null,"assignee_team":null,"removed_assignee":false,"resolve_doer":null,"dependent_issue":null}]
